      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "The experimental discovery of the Higgs boson completed a central part of the Standard Model and is an exceptionally important result.",
        "attribution": "The discovery was made by the ATLAS and CMS collaborations. These names have substantial leadership and experimental contributions, but no small set of people can fully represent the teams.",
